// neon.test.js — collision coverage.
//
// Issue #1 asked for every brick-bounce case to land as a test: per-face
// bounce (top/bottom, side), corner hits, push-out (no sticky bounce), seams
// (two bricks destroyed, one bounce), tunnelling (swept detection), plus an
// integration test through step()/frame(). Still NOT covered: score/combo
// logic (see ISSUES.md #5) and level progression.

